    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a part-time hobby project, which is why the game is available for free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Patch 1.1.0 has been released!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>We have managed to publish our game in English via machine translation</u>! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bugs in Seiichi's route have also been fixed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Connected through fate</strong> tells the story of our heroine, who is about to move with her mother to a new city. At her new school, she gets acquainted with the three strange Ichigawa brothers. The three brothers could not be more different, and so their first day is already extremely turbulent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it's not just these strange encounters that will soon turn her entire life upside down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions influence the course of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who will be by your side until the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your destiny now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Connected through Fate we want to tell a deep, exciting but dramatic story. Through the four main characters and a total of 8 different endings, the player will be able to explore the characters and take his fate into his own hands.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A romantic and dramatic otome game or let's just say a dromatic game ;D</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a part-time hobby project, which is why the game is available for free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Patch 1.1.0 has been released!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>We have managed to publish our game in English via machine translation</u>! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bugs in Seiichi's route have also been fixed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Connected through fate</strong> tells the story of our heroine, who is about to move with her mother to a new city. At her new school, she gets acquainted with the three strange Ichigawa brothers. The three brothers could not be more different, and so their first day is already extremely turbulent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it's not just these strange encounters that will soon turn her entire life upside down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions influence the course of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who will be by your side until the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your destiny now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Connected through Fate we want to tell a deep, exciting but dramatic story. Through the four main characters and a total of 8 different endings, the player will be able to explore the characters and take his fate into his own hands.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A romantic and dramatic otome game or let's just say a dromatic game ;D</p>",
